&lt;p&gt;I am a Distinguished Platform Engineering Architect in the VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) Division at Broadcom. My primary focus is helping customers and partners build, run and operate a modern Private Cloud using either VMware vSphere Foundation (VVF) or VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF). One of my primary responsibilities is driving VMware&#39;s Customer[0] organization and co-developing products and services with both Product and Engineering leaders, by providing early feedback on the usability, design and architecture across VMware&#39;s Private, Hybrid and Public Cloud offerings. Lastly, through customer interactions I continue to champion their challenges and needs to help further improve VMware’s products and services.&lt;/p&gt; 
